# Agent coordination

Before starting work after a new user direction, and before ending a session:

1. Read `AGENT_HANDOFF.md`
2. Claim or update the Active work slot you are using
3. Append a short note to the Message board when you finish or hand off
4. Never commit secrets (`.env`, Pi passwords, Wi‑Fi PSK)

Canonical plan: `docs/roadmap.md`. Freezes: `docs/priority-review.md`.
